msgctxt "64"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Thank goodness you're here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "You're not hurt, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"No... But there's no telling what might happen if we don't hand over the "
"money. They said they need it all by the end of the day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"The total comes out to two million yen, plus interest. I understand that. "
"But now, all of a sudden, they're claiming a totally different amount. It's "
"crazy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "*sob* Oh... What are we to do...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"It's gonna be all right, Mom! You wait here with Nana. I'll try and reason "
"with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Don't do it, Nao! It's too dangerous to go alone! Who knows what they would "
"do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "In that case, why don't we go together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Are... you sure, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Clearly they're not the best of people. So consider me your \"backup "
"plan.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "You have no idea how much this means to us..."
msgstr ""

